{"3904960":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Scribble Bots","steam_appid":3904960,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scribble bots is a multiplayer, physics based party game, where you draw a robot, then play as your drawing in a variety of fun and goofy game modes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw Your Robot!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you are given total creative freedom to draw your robot however you wish. You can draw limbs and bodies of any shape or size, and decorate your robot how you see fit. As each robot is simulated physically, your drawing has a drastic impact on your gameplay. Will you draw a functional masterpiece, or an inoperable abomination?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e32407bfda2637c37608fd67451067a8.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e32407bfda2637c37608fd67451067a8.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Your Friends!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your friends and their robots, both online and offline, in a variety of game modes and maps, including soccer, racing and king of the hill. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/ed2746fc2fdf7bd29b548b957e090a85.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/ed2746fc2fdf7bd29b548b957e090a85.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Powerups!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add powerups to your robot, such as thrusters, wheels and rocket launchers to add new dimensions to the gameplay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e61d2a0c32829e80898d0ec0212055a4.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e61d2a0c32829e80898d0ec0212055a4.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlimited Possibilities!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your robot however you want to! See what works, what doesn't work. Experiment, test your robot, iterate, decorate, until you have the perfect design. Or just draw something silly and have a good time!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/5859796299ef77d8d480e9bcaa79e71d.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/5859796299ef77d8d480e9bcaa79e71d.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local multiplayer with up to 4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play different game modes: Soccer, Race, King of the Hill, Battle, Hide and seek, and Collect the Coins<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on 15+ maps<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 10+ powerups<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hats and cosmetics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your robot in a shared lobby<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily share your robot via copy paste<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Coming Next?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After release, my first priority will be adding more content, so more maps, powerups and game modes. After a few content updates, I will switch my focus to mod support, and a custom map creator.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Did you use AI do develop this?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only AI used in the development of this game was the google AI summaries unconsensually shoved in my face while searching for the godot documentation. So no.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scribble bots is a multiplayer, physics based party game, where you draw a robot, then play as your drawing in a variety of fun and goofy game modes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw Your Robot!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you are given total creative freedom to draw your robot however you wish. You can draw limbs and bodies of any shape or size, and decorate your robot how you see fit. As each robot is simulated physically, your drawing has a drastic impact on your gameplay. Will you draw a functional masterpiece, or an inoperable abomination?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e32407bfda2637c37608fd67451067a8.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e32407bfda2637c37608fd67451067a8.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Your Friends!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your friends and their robots, both online and offline, in a variety of game modes and maps, including soccer, racing and king of the hill. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/ed2746fc2fdf7bd29b548b957e090a85.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/ed2746fc2fdf7bd29b548b957e090a85.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Powerups!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add powerups to your robot, such as thrusters, wheels and rocket launchers to add new dimensions to the gameplay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e61d2a0c32829e80898d0ec0212055a4.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/e61d2a0c32829e80898d0ec0212055a4.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlimited Possibilities!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your robot however you want to! See what works, what doesn't work. Experiment, test your robot, iterate, decorate, until you have the perfect design. Or just draw something silly and have a good time!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/5859796299ef77d8d480e9bcaa79e71d.poster.avif?t=1771310441\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/extras\/5859796299ef77d8d480e9bcaa79e71d.mp4?t=1771310441\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local multiplayer with up to 4 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play different game modes: Soccer, Race, King of the Hill, Battle, Hide and seek, and Collect the Coins<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on 15+ maps<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 10+ powerups<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hats and cosmetics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your robot in a shared lobby<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily share your robot via copy paste<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's Coming Next?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After release, my first priority will be adding more content, so more maps, powerups and game modes. After a few content updates, I will switch my focus to mod support, and a custom map creator.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Did you use AI do develop this?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only AI used in the development of this game was the google AI summaries unconsensually shoved in my face while searching for the godot documentation. So no.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Draw your robot, play as your drawing! Face your friends in Scribble Bots, a 2D, physics based sandbox party game. Will your robot be a mechanical masterpiece, or a dysfunctional abomination?","supported_languages":"영어<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/00c8900f7ce947baf4435168f87b8ca2af49eff6\/header.jpg?t=1771310441","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/9d47e44a8889fb054865476197437869cd6ec280\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771310441","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3904960\/9d47e44a8889fb054865476197437869cd6ec280\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771310441","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프